        "message": "wp1334: chuoi realpath tinh tu duong goc, khong tu ban da abspath\n\nReview PR #1367 (comment 4597850151): _trong_kho_git goi abspath truoc\nrealpath nen `..` dung sau symlink bi gop theo tu vung. Voi\n<ngoai>/lk/../codexhome (lk -> <kho>/con) chot tra None trong khi kernel\nghi vao <kho>/codexhome. Tai lap tren 8ed3503: auth.json va tep dau deu\nlot vao kho.\n\n- scripts/tl_gws.py: hai chuoi la abspath(path) va realpath(path).\n- ops/cloud_agent_creds_test.py: ca pd8 (bon bien the + ve duong ngoai\n  kho), dot bien PD8_realpath_sau_abspath.\n- RELEASE_MANIFEST.json tai sinh.\n\nBo test: 60/60, 91/91. selftest 1777/1777.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZ6bCzNXoqjwqyrJTq",
